  characterName: "Bartolina Quispe \u25CF \u25CB \u25CB"
  promptText: "Brother Leaf, Earthbending Global wants the lithium under our salt
    flats. They promise schools and jobs, but their pumps would drain our drinking
    springs. \n\nDo we open the door?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, open talks. Schools and jobs help now.
  rightAnswer: No, close the door. The springs come first
